<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs up $1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were barrows and gilts were $1.00 higher than Thursday's close. Demand was good and supply was moderate. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    230-260 lbs    56.00-58.00</p>
<p>    US 1-2    210-220 lbs    53.00-56.00</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-230 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3    260-270 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>		  270-280 lbs    54.00-55.00</p>
<p>Sows - steady. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-500 lbs    41.00-44.00</p>
<p>		  over 500 lbs    47.00-52.00</p>
</text>
